BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wyxr-event-d9f25ad6-1936-46f4-8be3-29af15dda06b@concert-calendar.wyxr.o
 rg
DTSTAMP:20260902T193432Z
DTSTART:20260909T230000Z
DTEND:20260910T020000Z
SUMMARY:WYXR's Stereo Session featuring KWICK's "To The Point" — Memphis 
 Listening Lab
LOCATION:Memphis Listening Lab\, Memphis\, TN
DESCRIPTION:Show 6 PM\nReleased in 1981 on EMI America\, To The Point finds
  KWICK operating in the fertile but competitive aftermath of Stax Records
 ’ collapse\, when Memphis funk bands were recalibrating for a new era. E
 merging from the Stax-affiliated vocal group the Newcomers\, KWICK fused d
 eep harmony traditions with sleek synthesizers\, dance-floor precision\, a
 nd forward-leaning studio polish.\n\nUnder the guidance of producer and ex
 ecutive Allen Jones—architect of the Bar-Kays’ reinvention—KWICK was
  part of a wave of self-contained Memphis groups vying for position just b
 eneath the city’s reigning funk institution. Alongside contemporaries li
 ke Ebonee Webb\, Kilo\, Galaxy\, and The Main Attraction\, KWICK helped de
 fine a post-Stax sound that embraced disco’s momentum without abandoning
  Memphis’s muscular groove.\n\nTo The Point captures that moment with cl
 arity and confidence—a record shaped by ambition\, adaptation\, and the 
 enduring belief that Memphis funk still had places to go.\nTickets: https:
 //wyxr.org/wyxr-stereo-sessions/\nhttps://concert-calendar.wyxr.org/e/d9f2
 5ad6-1936-46f4-8be3-29af15dda06b
URL:https://wyxr.org/wyxr-stereo-sessions/
CATEGORIES:WYXR Presents,WYXR Pick
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T193457Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
