BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wyxr-event-4a57a885-7f15-4ab8-9f5f-614e5935a05f@concert-calendar.wyxr.o
 rg
DTSTAMP:20260902T193432Z
DTSTART:20260919T210000Z
DTEND:20260920T000000Z
SUMMARY:Larry Heard "On My Way" Book Signing — Memphis Listening Lab
LOCATION:Memphis Listening Lab\, Memphis\, TN
DESCRIPTION:Show 4 PM\nLarry Heard and Ross Devlin invite you to celebrate 
 the release of their new book\, "On My Way"\, at the Memphis Listening Lab
 .\n\n“For 40 years\, Larry Heard traveled the world\, performing his spe
 cial blend of soulful Deep House music. From Fingers Inc to Mr. Fingers an
 d beyond\, these moments are captured in “On My Way”\, a 365-page book
  that documents this incredible journey through Larry’s eyes. Working wi
 th fellow Memphian Ross Devlin\, “On My Way” is a singular history of 
 House Music and the people who made it happen.\n\nJoin us at the Memphis L
 istening Lab on September 19th\, from 4-7pm\, as Larry and Ross present th
 is new book for the first time in public. The two will discuss the book al
 ong with music historian and WYXR program manager Jared "Jay B." Boyd. Ple
 ase RSVP to secure your place\, as seating will be limited.\nTickets: http
 s://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/wyxr-and-the-memphis-listening-lab-present-on-m
 y-way-book-release-party-tickets-1998495811771\nhttps://concert-calendar.w
 yxr.org/e/4a57a885-7f15-4ab8-9f5f-614e5935a05f
URL:https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/wyxr-and-the-memphis-listening-lab-prese
 nt-on-my-way-book-release-party-tickets-1998495811771
CATEGORIES:WYXR Presents,WYXR Pick
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T193457Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
